          A heat pump water heater can cut the electricity used for hot water by well over half. Whether it works in your house comes down to space, air temperature, voltage, and buying a size larger than the tank it replaces.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="#rheem-proterra-50"
            class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#FF4500] hover:bg-[#E63E00] text-white font-black rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all no-underline"
          >
            See Our #1 Pick
          </a>
          <a
            href="#top-picks"
            class="px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold rounded-xl border border-white/10 no-underline"
          >
            Compare All Picks
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Author & Meta -->
